# Dreadwing Scavenger, a 2/2 flier: "Whenever this creature enters or attacks, draw a card, then discard a card." and "Threshold - this
# creature gets +1/+1 and has deathtouch as long as there are seven or more cards in your graveyard" (CR 207.2c). Bot1 casts it on turn 1
# (it loots: one card in the graveyard) and then a Thought Scour on itself, which mills two and goes to the graveyard: four. On turn 3
# a Thought Scour at Bot2 makes five; the Scavenger attacks (2 damage) and its loot makes six: still a 2/2 without deathtouch. On turn 5
# its loot makes the seventh card: a 3/3 with deathtouch that deals 3.

